<title>GERMANY: Porsche H1 96/97 profit more than trebles.</title>
<headline>Porsche H1 96/97 profit more than trebles.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31, first half of 1996/1997 business year</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group profit				 36	vs 10.3</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,700   up 20 pct</p>
<p>    Group unit sales of Porsche cars     12,800 units up 25 pct</p>
<p>--of which 3,150 Boxster cars</p>
<p>    Parent company workforce (headcount) 7,008   vs 6,444</p>
<p>    Group workforce (headcount)	    7,890   vs 6,908</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German luxury carmaker is Dr. Ing. h.c. F. Porsche AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525.</p>
</text>
